      "question_text": "<h3>Canary heading three</h3><h4>Canary heading four</h4><p>Paragraph with <strong>strong</strong>, <em>em</em>, <b>b</b>, <i>i</i>, <u>u</u>, x<sup>2</sup>, H<sub>2</sub>O, and inline <code>print(x)</code>.<br>Line after a br.</p><ul><li>Unordered one</li><li>Unordered two</li></ul><ol><li>Ordered one</li><li>Ordered two</li></ol><p><a href=\"https://pearland.instructure.com/courses/121046/pages/cse-field-probe-page-html-canaries-2026-10-10\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://pearland.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/121046/pages/cse-field-probe-page-html-canaries-2026-10-10\" data-api-returntype=\"Page\">Relative course page link</a> and <a href=\"https://www.python.org/\">external link</a>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Input</th><th>Output</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Spans both columns</td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"https://pearland.instructure.com/courses/121046/files/18945746/preview?verifier=REDACTED\" alt=\"Canary course image\" loading=\"lazy\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://pearland.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/121046/files/18945746\" data-api-returntype=\"File\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Centered with an inline style.</p><p>LaTeX as typed: \\(x^2 + 3x = 10\\)</p><p>Equation image: <img class=\"equation_image\" title=\"x^2\" src=\"https://pearland.instructure.com/equation_images/x%255E2?scale=1\" alt=\"LaTeX: x^2\" data-equation-content=\"x^2\" loading=\"lazy\" x-canvaslms-safe-mathml=\"<math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;>\n  <msup>\n    <mi>x</mi>\n    <mn>2</mn>\n  </msup>\n</math>\"></p><pre style=\"background-color:#272822;color:#F8F8F2;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;display:block;\"><code><span style=\"color:#66D9EF\">if</span> x <span style=\"color:#F92672\">&lt;</span> <span style=\"color:#AE81FF\">10</span> <span style=\"color:#F9